sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Refresh rotates a single-use credential against current account evidence
  accDescr: The browser client serializes renewal across tabs. The portal checks transport, current local identity evidence, deadlines, and replay history before committing a new credential. A spent credential cannot be retried safely after an uncertain response. Native body transport uses explicit JSON credentials rather than this browser cookie exchange.
  participant B as Browser coordinator
  participant P as Portal
  participant S as Account and session state
  B->>B: Serialize renewal across tabs
  B->>P: Same-origin POST with current refresh cookie
  P->>S: Check family, deadlines, current evidence, replay
  alt Credential is spent or account evidence changed
    S-->>P: Deny, replay revokes descendants
    P-->>B: Fresh authentication required
  else Eligible renewal
    P->>S: Commit rotation and spent-credential history
    S-->>P: Commit succeeds
    P-->>B: Replace access and refresh cookies
  end
  Note over B,P: Uncertain response: fresh login, no retry of old credential
